            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You unleash a cloud of pollen or similar spores. All creatures in a 10-foot emanation around you must attempt a Fortitude save using your class DC or spell DC (whichever is higher) with the following results. Plants and fungi are immune to this effect.\n\n- **Critical Success:** No effect.\n- **Success:** The creature is dazzled for 1 round.\n- **Failure:** The creature is dazzled and can see only 10 feet away for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is blinded for 1 round."
            }
          }
        }
